\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11893064\charrsid1732844  If the time between violation & the respective penalty implementation lengthens, the impact of the disciplinary action will:}{\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11893064\charrsid1732844 
\par        \u9658\'3f }{\cf2\ulc0\insrsid11893064\charrsid1732844 Be exceeded}{\cf2\ulc0\insrsid13045389\charrsid1732844  (Correct)}{\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11893064\charrsid1732844 
