\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11893064\charrsid1732844  }{\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11893064\charrsid1732844 Yousaf has beaten his fellow employee for which his manager has dismissed him. Evaluate manager\rquote s response in terms of ethical application of power.}{
