\par }{\cf2\ulc0\insrsid11893064\charrsid1732844 No employee is supposed to get physical with any of the colleagues. Manager\rquote 
s decision was the extreme as he could have brought both employees together and tried to know the problem between them. I see this move as an unethical act by the manager.}{\cf2\ulc0\insrsid14507131\charrsid1732844 
